-- 4. Buoc chuoi chinh KHONG gan ban do (dem / mac do / nau / quan sat / chon / cau do / den noi) ma chu ghi ban do khoa cao
--    hon cap buoc (Rung Viridian cap 29 o buoc cap 8, Nui Mat Trang 33 o cap 14-16, Tau S.S. Anne 65 o cap 26-29...): bo noi
--    hoac doi sang ban do co dung quai / mo dung cap. KHONG ha khoa Rung Viridian / Nui Mat Trang: quai o do cap 33-39 la
--    muc tieu cua 45 nhiem vu cap 28-40 (CA-06 / CA-07, chuong 16-23, Pokedex D-032..038) - ha khoa / ha cap quai se pha
--    thang cap; giu buoc dia diem da doi o mo_duong_dia_diem.sql. Dao dat / vat an o ban do khoa cao hon: doi ban do.
